@startuml
title SD04 - Complete Quiz and Update Progress
actor Student
participant QuizController as UI
participant QuizService as Quiz
participant GradingService as Grading
participant QuizAttemptRepository as Attempts
participant QuizCompletedEvent as Event
participant ProgressUpdateListener as ProgressListener
participant ProgressService as Progress
participant TopicProgressRepository as TopicProgress
participant AdaptiveLearningListener as Adaptive
Student -> UI: submitQuiz(quizId, responses)
UI -> Quiz: submitQuiz(request)
Quiz -> Grading: grade(quiz, responses)
Grading --> Quiz: GradeResult
Quiz -> Attempts: save(attempt)
Quiz -> Event: publish(completed)
Event -> ProgressListener: onQuizCompleted(event)
ProgressListener -> Progress: updateProgress(event)
Progress -> TopicProgress: saveAll(updatedTopics)
Event -> Adaptive: onQuizCompleted(event)
Adaptive --> Event: mark recommendations stale
Quiz --> UI: score and per-question results
@enduml
